{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40028","headline":"笋鞭 · 徐夤","name":"笋鞭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筇竹岩边剔翠苔，锦江波冷洗琼瑰。\n累累节转苍龙骨，寸寸珠联巨蚌胎。\n须向广场驱驵骏，莫从闲处挞驽骀。\n宁同晋帝环营日，抛赚中途後骑来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}